### HMAC-SHA-1 — output shape

#### MAC is exactly 20 bytes

- Verify: MAC is exactly 20 bytes
   - Expected: hmac_sha1("k", "m").len() equals `20`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 3 lines folded for reproduction.
